1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,417
Tiziri is a fashion
boutique in Tigzirt, in

2
00:00:03,417 --> 00:00:05,759
Kabylie, with its whole wardrobe online.

3
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:10,531
Elle and Lui, our wooden
mannequins, wear every piece.

4
00:00:11,281 --> 00:00:14,192
Every garment is photographed
in the shop, then cut

5
00:00:14,192 --> 00:00:17,104
out and set in the light,
without changing a thing.

6
00:00:18,154 --> 00:00:22,356
In the fitting room, you pick a piece:
they try it on, then start walking.

7
00:00:24,006 --> 00:00:26,731
Around it, the mascot
keeps a plain ecru base

8
00:00:26,731 --> 00:00:29,698
outfit, never for sale:
the piece stays the star.

9
00:00:31,348 --> 00:00:35,239
On the runway, the whole shop
goes by, piece after piece.

10
00:00:37,689 --> 00:00:40,781
The wardrobe sorts itself
in one tap: dresses,

11
00:00:40,781 --> 00:00:43,335
tops, jackets, bottoms or traditional.

12
00:00:44,785 --> 00:00:46,970
Slide: raw photo or staging, it's the same

13
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,999
piece, the one you'll find in the shop.

14
00:00:50,749 --> 00:00:54,330
Like a piece? Send a WhatsApp
message: pick it up in the shop, or

15
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:57,911
get it delivered to any of the 58
provinces, and pay on delivery.

16
00:00:58,361 --> 00:01:03,685
Tiziri: the shop comes alive. This
demo website is free and open source,

17
00:01:03,685 --> 00:01:08,935
in French, Arabic, English and Spanish.
The link is in the description.
